	(text "U1001 operates at 400 kHz with PFM at light load. L1001 (100 uH), C1004/C1005\n(22 uF each) and C1006 (100 nF) filter P15_RAW. C1002/C1003 bypass the input;\nC1001 is the CB-to-SW bootstrap capacitor."
