	(text "Generates P15 from BUS24 for the positive AFE supply. CMD_P15 controls\nwhether this rail is enabled. The nominal pre-shunt voltage is approximately\n+15 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
