	(text "R1002 (392 kOhm) and R1003 (22.1 kOhm) set P15_RAW:\nVRAW = 0.8 V x (1 + R1002/R1003) = 14.99 V.\nTo change the voltage: R1002 = R1003 x (VRAW/0.8 V - 1). Increasing the upper\nresistor raises VRAW."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
