	(text "R1004 (0.1 Ohm) causes a 100 mV/A drop; feedback is before the shunt. U1001\nis a 1 A IC with internal current, short-circuit and thermal protection.\nR1006 (100 kOhm) bleeds P15 after shutdown. D1001 indicates rail presence; it\nis not a power-good output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
